# Apocalypse Nigh (battlefield.apocalypse_nigh, Empyreal Paradox): main (accepted, Prog 3) registers and invites bob,
# cat, dan and eve. A helper passes by having the quest completed (bob) or accepted at the var or higher (dan, Prog 5:
# the menu, option 17); cat (accepted, Prog 1: below) and eve (no quest) get a lone release, no menu. The win for the
# party; each finish (main's moves Prog 3 to 4), whose setPos zones main, bob and dan out.
lists EmpyrealParadox/TR_Entrance/onTrigger EmpyrealParadox/onEventUpdate/32000 EmpyrealParadox/onEventFinish/32000 EmpyrealParadox/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=EmpyrealParadox pos=541.5,-1.2,-597.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=EmpyrealParadox pos=541.5,-1.2,-597.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=EmpyrealParadox pos=541.5,-1.2,-597.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char dan zone=EmpyrealParadox pos=541.5,-1.2,-597.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char eve zone=EmpyrealParadox pos=541.5,-1.2,-597.7 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.ApocalypseNigh accepted
charvar Quest[3][89]Prog 3
bob: quest Jeuno.ApocalypseNigh completed
cat: quest Jeuno.ApocalypseNigh accepted
cat: charvar Quest[3][89]Prog 1
dan: quest Jeuno.ApocalypseNigh accepted
dan: charvar Quest[3][89]Prog 5
login
bob: login
invite bob
bob: accept
cat: login
invite cat
cat: accept
dan: login
invite dan
dan: accept
eve: login
invite eve
eve: accept
trigger TR_Entrance
update 32000 option=17
finish
bob: trigger TR_Entrance
bob: update 32000 option=17
bob: finish
cat: trigger TR_Entrance
cat: update 32000 option=17
cat: finish
dan: trigger TR_Entrance
dan: update 32000 option=17
dan: finish
eve: trigger TR_Entrance
eve: update 32000 option=17
eve: finish
kill KAMLANAUT
kill KAMLANAUT+1
finish
bob: finish
cat: finish
dan: finish
eve: finish
tick 11000
